6. The Citizen Lab, citizenlab/malware-indicators
   https://github.com/citizenlab/malware-indicators
   Cites: The Citizen Lab, 'The Million Dollar Dissident' (2016-08);
   'Champing at the Cyberbit' (2017-12); 'The Kingdom Came to Canada'
   (2018-10); 'Reckless Exploit' (2017-06), Mexico; 'Reckless Redux'
