These two repositories are not shipped inside the app; the app downloads
their data directly from the original repositories at the pinned commits.
Amnesty's README states "These indicators are shared under the license CC-BY"
(version 2.0 link); the Citizen Lab README states Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0, whose NonCommercial and ShareAlike
terms do not fit redistribution inside an Apache-2.0 package. Spyhound
therefore leaves both out of the APK.

