== Libraries ==

Shizuku API and provider (Apache License 2.0)
https://github.com/RikkaApps/Shizuku-API

libadb-android 3.1.1 (Muntashir Al-Islam), used for the built-in ADB
connection to this phone's own wireless debugging. Dual licensed under
GPL-3.0-or-later or Apache-2.0; Spyhound uses it under Apache-2.0.
https://github.com/MuntashirAkon/libadb-android
It is not on Maven Central; it is resolved from JitPack at build time only
(see settings.gradle.kts). Its dependency spake2-android (MuntashirAkon/
spake2-java, Apache-2.0 per its repository) and Conscrypt (Apache-2.0,
https://github.com/google/conscrypt) are packaged with the app.
